  /* Paging and search.

     ss-card-paged-out is the server's first page: cards past the tenth start
     hidden so the browser never lays them out on load. ss-card-filtered is the
     search box's, kept separate so clearing a search restores exactly the page
     the pager was on instead of collapsing back to ten. */
  .ss-card-paged-out,
