          <span class="sf-badge">{% if is_claimable %}Live store ready to claim{% else %}A private store built for{% endif %}</span>
          <h1 class="sf-title">{{ store_name }}</h1>
          <p class="sf-sub">{% if is_claimable %}Preview the live store, then sign in to claim it. The first verified claimant becomes the store administrator.{% else %}Access your private store and place member orders.{% endif %}</p>

          {%- comment -%}
            Preview leads. It is the smaller ask, and someone who has seen the
            store is a far better candidate for an account than someone being
            asked to make one sight unseen. Joining stays one tap away here and
            is repeated inside the preview itself.
          {%- endcomment -%}
          <div class="sf-btn-stack">
            {%- comment -%}
              Send guests into Shopify Customer Accounts. Shopify presents Sign in
              with Shop when available and email one-time-code access otherwise.
